      ro: [],
      en: ["Located in the town of Mueda, Cabo Delgado Province.", "Commemorates the massacre that occurred on June 16, 1960.", "The event is considered the catalyst for the Mozambican War of Independence.", "Portuguese troops fired on an unarmed crowd of Makonde petitioners.", "The date is marked annually as a national day of remembrance.", "Serves as a focal point for national liberation history."]
